2, "text": "So forget the luxury and the pretense,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Come into our world, join the dance,"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Cause we\u2019re cheap, and proud to be so,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Together, we\u2019ll make this planet glow."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}